# Keeps the directory in git.
#
# The build context needs `vendor/` to exist even when the binary is absent:
# `COPY vendor/ /tmp/vendor/` fails with "not found" on a directory that does
# not exist at all, and a fresh clone has no vendor/ because the binary itself
# is gitignored. With this file the COPY succeeds, the Dockerfile sees no
# binary, and falls back to downloading mihomo — which is what CI does.
